id: pm-um3teu
title: Bound read-only telemetry volume with paired weighted sampling
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1241. Read-only commands support bounded sampling with explicit inclusion probability on both lifecycle events; mutating commands and errors remain unsampled; controls are documented and tested through the SDK."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-12T21:08:21.753Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-12T21:56:03.390Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-12T21:56:02.852Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-12T21:56:02.852Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Read-only commands support bounded sampling with explicit inclusion probability on both lifecycle events; mutating commands and errors remain unsampled; controls are documented and tested through the SDK.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Bound read-only telemetry volume with paired weighted sampling
value: Reliable privacy-preserving operational context for agents and package consumers
parent: pm-5oj5
resolution: Explicit core-only read sampling retains or drops complete successful lifecycle pairs and includes effective inclusion probability; failed reads and writes remain unsampled.
expected_result: Repeated core-only reads must support bounded volume with weightable pairs and complete failure evidence.
actual_result: "Deterministic retained, dropped and failure pairs pass; invalid rates, mutations and extension-enabled invocations remain unsampled. Sampling is opt-in and interrupted sampled reads have no pair as documented."
